{{.Note}}

This page lists every route the AgentOven control plane (version {{.Version}}) serves, grouped by area. It is generated by walking the real router, so a route is listed exactly when the server has it. The same data is available as an [OpenAPI 3.1 document](/openapi.json) for tooling.

<Callout type="limit" title="Request and response schemas are not included yet">

Paths, methods and path parameters are exact. Bodies and responses are not described here yet; the guides show the working request for each feature, and the Python and TypeScript SDKs wrap the most common calls. Routes that AgentOven Pro adds (realtime, staged skill registration, environments, test suites and others) are not part of this list.

</Callout>

## Calling the API

Send JSON, name the workspace with the `X-Kitchen` header (the default kitchen is used when omitted), and authenticate with `Authorization: Bearer <key>` or `X-API-Key: <key>` when the server has authentication enabled. Everything under `/api/v1` is versioned together.

```bash
curl -s http://localhost:8080/api/v1/agents -H "X-Kitchen: default"
```
